msgid ""
"%(document)s amount has changed since approval was granted.\n"
"\n"
"Approved amount: %(symbol_approved)s %(approved)s\n"
"Current amount: %(symbol_current)s %(current)s\n"
"\n"
"Please refuse the current approval and request a new one with the updated amount."
msgstr ""
"El importe de %(document)s cambió después de otorgada la aprobación.\n"
"\n"
"Importe aprobado: %(symbol_approved)s %(approved)s\n"
"Importe actual: %(symbol_current)s %(current)s\n"
"\n"
"Rechace la aprobación actual y solicite una nueva con el importe actualizado."

