#. module: approval_account
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:approval_account.field_approval_request__bank_statement_line_id
msgid ""
"Select the bank transaction that corresponds to this payment. The amount is "
"matched on its absolute value: an outgoing payment appears as a negative "
"statement line."
msgstr ""
"Seleccione la transacción bancaria que corresponde a este pago. El importe "
"se compara por su valor absoluto: un pago de salida aparece como una línea "
"de extracto negativa."

#. module: approval_account
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:approval_account.action_approval_request_to_invoice
msgid ""
"Select the requests and use \"Create Journal Entries\" to invoice them all "
"at once."
msgstr ""
"Selecciona las solicitudes y usa \"Crear asientos contables\" para "
"facturarlas todas de una vez."

